on between the squirrel and the tiger.\n9.**The tiger is kind.** This provides information about the tiger\'s personality trait.\n10.**The tiger is nice.** This gives us additional information about the tiger\'s disposition.\n11.**If someone visits the mouse then the mouse is nice.** This is a conditional statement about the mouse\'s niceness based on visits.\n12.**If someone eats the mouse and they visit the tiger then the mouse is green.** This is another conditional statement about the mouse\'s color based on actions.\n13.**Big, nice people are round.** This is a general statement about the shape of nice people.\n14.**If the mouse is green then the mouse is big.** This is a conditional statement about the mouse\'s size based on its color.\n15.**If the lion is nice then the lion does not visit the tiger.** This is a conditional statement about the lion\'s behavior based on its niceness.\n16.**If someone is round and big then they like the lion.The mouse likes the lion.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
