ind.\n14.**If Anne is round then Anne is kind.** This statement tells us that if Anne is round, then she is kind.\n15.**If Anne is smart and Anne is quiet then Anne is not round.** This statement tells us that if Anne is smart and quiet, then she is not round.\nSince Harry is blue and round, and round things are kind, Harry is kind. Additionally, since Harry is not quiet, and quiet things are young, Harry is old.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
