en).\n17.**If the bear is big then the bear likes the dog.** (Given).\n18.**If something needs the bear and the bear needs the dog then the bear is red.** (Given).\n19.**If something likes the bear and it is big then it needs the dog.** (Given).\nThe cat does not like the dog.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
