tatement "Rough, white things are quiet" does not directly apply to Gary because Gary is not white.Instead, we need to consider the information about Gary\'s characteristics:.\n\n- Gary is cold.\n- Gary is quiet.\n\nSince Gary is not cold and noisy, and we know that smooth, black things are noisy, Gary can be rough.Therefore, Gary must be old.\n\nGiven that Gary is not cold and noisy, and we know that smooth, black things are noisy, Gary can be rough.Therefore, Gary must be old.\n\nSince Gary is white and we have no information that contradicts this, the statement "Gary is white" is true based on the given information.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
